// Signing configuration.
//
// This repo does not hardcode an Apple Developer Team ID. Set yours in an
// untracked Config/Local.xcconfig (gitignored):
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM_DEFAULT = ABCDE12345
//
// Run ./Scripts/setup-dev.sh to generate that file, or copy
// Config/Local.xcconfig.example and fill in your team.
//
// A team ID is required to build: both targets carry an app-group entitlement,
// and the entitlement check runs per target, so a build with no team fails with
// "has entitlements that require signing with a development certificate."
// Setting AUTOMOUNT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM in the environment works too, and takes
// precedence over this file.
//
// The `include?` is optional-include: a missing file is not an error, so a
// fresh clone still opens in Xcode.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
